WEBVTT

00:09:28.635 --> 00:09:32.096
lakini unahitaji alama za tahadhari katika maisha yako.

00:09:32.096 --> 00:09:34.229
Na unaposimama.

00:09:34.229 --> 00:09:36.457
kinachofata ni kuangalia.

00:09:36.457 --> 00:09:38.985
Unaangalia.Unafungua machi yako.

00:09:38.985 --> 00:09:41.271
Unafungua masikio.Unafungua pua.

00:09:41.271 --> 00:09:43.594
Unafungua milango yote ya fahamu

00:09:43.594 --> 00:09:46.946
kwa huu utajiri mzuri tuliopewa.

00:09:46.946 --> 00:09:48.588
Hauna mwisho,

00:09:48.588 --> 00:09:51.121
na hivyo maisha yalivyo,

00:09:51.121 --> 00:09:54.932
kufurahia,kufurahi kile tulichopewa.

00:09:54.932 --> 00:09:57.547
Na baada ya hapo tunaweza fungua mioyo yetu,

00:09:57.547 --> 00:10:00.621
kwa ajili ya nafasi,